        "created_at": "2022-05-04T09:24:35.929Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay I admit it, that title is a complete clickbait lie; I’m sure we’ve all barbecued a Kraken or two during our visits to the Ruins of Atlantis, so there’s not much I can add.  But it seemed appropriate to toss my one-liner joke while enroute to another bit.  In an otherwise disastrously gone-wrong Vengeance game, where Naturalist was left alive at 1 HP and about to die to a bunch of Proletariat clones, along with the entire Slaughterhouse Six and a very well-fed Bugbear, I got a momentary reprieve when Entry Point came out.  Usually this card would just make me even more dead, but instead it made the 9-HP Comrade There-Are-Seven-Of-Me realize that it was past his bedtime.  I think his expression in this screenshot really says it all.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb\" title=\"Screenshot_20220504-041445\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220504-041445\" data-base62-sha1=\"iNpgSI8c9Ow1IDIhWZOW0W3u2Qr\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/83bce7453f2c60720518a7976d256d6372be27bb_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220504-041445</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 122 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
